"""Mandated-form report renderer (plan.md vertical slice, architecture.md §8).

Contract for the implementation:

  - render into the applicable official template version; preserve required
    fields, labels, order, structure, units, date conventions, and output
    type — never substitute a generic narrative;
  - refuse (raise) when the template is unknown, unverified, superseded, or
    date-inapplicable: blocked, not a compliant-looking report;
  - field mapping is deterministic; an LLM may draft only explicitly
    permitted explanatory fields;
  - record template id/version/checksum, renderer version, and field-map
    version on the ReportRecord.

If no official form is verified, use the clearly labeled synthetic template
in fixtures/ and leave compliance_claim False (no compliance claim).
"""
